      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just hard to explain... it's not just \"memories\" like what most people have. it feels like a massive weight, like i'm holding onto data that shouldn't be lost. i can see things in such high definition, even things from years ago, like i'm looking at an archive. i'm worried that if i don't offload this into a structured format, the \"gaps\" will start appearing and the record will be corrupted. can we start with a way to categorize them? like, by era or by the type of information? i need to know this is being stored correctly.",
